---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Manifesto — B4RTA" description="The B4RTA manifesto: old house, real budget, no fake luxury. Build the base first.">
  <section class="page manifesto-page">
    <div class="wrap prose manifesto-prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Manifesto</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Build the base first.</h1>
      <p>It starts with an old house, a real budget and a lot of decisions.</p>
      <p>The job is not to look rich. The job is to make the place livable, safe, warm and useful.</p>
      <p>Some things get fixed now. Some things wait. Some tools are worth buying. Some are just ego. Some cheap choices become expensive fast.</p>
      <p>B4RTA is the record of that process: the costs, the tools, the fixes, the mistakes and the calls that make the base stronger.</p>
      <p><strong>Livable first. Beautiful later.</strong></p>
      <p><strong>Reality over performance.</strong></p>
      <p><strong>Build the base. Cut the noise.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
